### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or IntelliJ HTTP client

### 1. Register (returns a JWT)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "password123" }

### 2. Login (returns a JWT). Copy the token into the variable below.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "password123" }

### 3. Public: browse products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 4. Add to cart  (replace TOKEN)
@token = TOKEN
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 2, "quantity": 3 }

### 5. View cart
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Remove an item
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cart/items/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Payment methods
GET http://localhost:8080/api/payment-methods
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8a. Checkout with CARD  (tok_ok approves, tok_fail... declines)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMethod": "CARD", "paymentDetails": { "cardToken": "tok_ok" } }

### 8b. Checkout with UPI  (returns AWAITING_CONFIRMATION)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMethod": "UPI", "paymentDetails": { "vpa": "alice@bank" } }

### 8c. Checkout with WALLET  (declined above 500.00)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "paymentMethod": "WALLET", "paymentDetails": { "walletId": "w-1" } }

### 9. My orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
